            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. A grievance concerning a layoff or discharge must be filed in writing within ten (10) working days after the last day worked or within ten (10) working days after the effective date of layoff or discharge, whichever is later, and processed in Step Two of the Grievance Procedure and in accordance with Section B.4. A Department Steward may file a grievance on behalf of an employee who is laid off while on an authorized Leave of Absence or Vacation provided such employee is not available to sign the grievance form. However, such laid-off employee shall appear at the meeting(s) at which his or her grievance is discussed.",
