        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. A grievance concerning a layoff or a discharge shall be signed by the employee concerned and one of the following: the employee's Department Steward, the employee's Senior Steward, or a Business Representative of the Union. Advance notice of a layoff or discharge shall be given to the Department Steward by the terminating employee's immediate Supervisor. In the event of an immediate suspension or discharge the immediate Supervisor shall notify the Department Steward as soon as possible, but in any event prior to the employee's departure, unless conditions require immediate removal from the premises.",
